- #781 (P6 PR3): what-ifs and what goes stale, a moved test reads unknown until acknowledged, a what-if on a premise reaches only what rests on it;
- #782 (P6 PR4): evidence with its grade, natural deduction (rule_node, establishes, conclusion_form, uses), now_refuted from the bulk writers;
- #783 (P6 PR5): small faults 1-15, same_formula_as, undocumented evidence reads conditional, the hub name-prefix fault;
